{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Behold</b> — Rabbi Moses said: We heard it through David, who was from Ephrathah. And what seems correct to me: In days gone by, men would say—we heard from the mouth of prophets—that the chosen place is near Bethlehem Ephrathah; only the place was not known, whether east of Bethlehem or west of it or to its north or to its south. And it is known that to this day there is between Jerusalem and Bethlehem only about three parasangs." "<b>In the field of Jaar</b> — For there was the threshing floor of Araunah the Jebusite."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 132, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:34.511814848Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}